# Ignore python temporary files
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# Ignore environmental variables (Secrets)
.env
.env.local
.venv
env/
venv/

# Ignore system files
.DS_Store

# Visual Studio local cache (locked by IDE, never commit)
.vs/

# .NET build output for the two MAUI apps (GustoPOS, GustoWaiter).
#
# Pure build products — every file here is regenerated by `dotnet build`, and
# they are large and binary (DLLs, PDBs, .exe, WinRT .winmd). 16,631 of them
# were committed before this rule existed, which is most of the repo by file
# count and makes any `git status` unreadable.
#
# NOTE: this rule only stops FUTURE ones being added. .gitignore has no effect
# on paths git already tracks, so removing the existing 16,631 from the index
# is a separate change.
gusto_pos/**/bin/
gusto_pos/**/obj/

# Python packaging output for mcp_server.
#
# `pip install .` makes setuptools copy the package into build/lib/ and write
# carevo_mcp.egg-info/ beside the source. Both are regenerated on every build
# and neither was ever committed — unlike the .NET case above, this rule is
# purely preventative, so there is no index to clean up.
#
# Worth having anyway: build/lib/ holds a FROZEN copy of every module, and a
# stale one already caused a wrong answer during a grep for callers of
# /api/v1/public/* — the same file appearing twice, one of them out of date.
mcp_server/build/
mcp_server/*.egg-info/

# Claude Code worktrees (ephemeral, not part of source)
.claude/worktrees/